<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA AND SWITZERLAND LEVEL 2-2 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA AND SWITZERLAND LEVEL 2-2 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KOSICE, Slovakia 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia and</p>
<p>Switzerland were level 2-2 in their Fed Cup tennis World Group</p>
<p>two first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Slovak names first):</p>
<p>Henrieta Nagyova beat Patty Schnyder 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova lost to Martina Hingis 2-6 0-6</p>
<p>Played Saturday</p>
<p>Katarina Studenikova lost to Martina Hingis 1-6 3-6</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova beat Patty Schnyder 7-5 6-1</p>
</text>
